  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In March 2026 official remarks, Malik said AI is moving from experimentation to enterprise-wide integration and that the priority is operationalizing it in core workflows to enhance risk management and resilience. In June 2026, he said AI adoption is moving from experimentation to implementation and that the challenge is operationalizing strategies at scale while maintaining trust, resilience, and effective governance in financial services. He said the AI Innovation Series convenes regulators and industry leaders to keep governance frameworks fit for purpose as AI becomes embedded in financial markets. A 2023 personal post said he shared how his team was developing AI capabilities to help clients deploy and scale AI, and an undated personal statement said innovation should be enabled without compromising safety and soundness.",
